{"strongs": "H2620", "word": "חָסָה", "translit": "cha.sah", "root": "חסה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "seek refuge", "definition": "חָסָה verb (mostly in poetry and figurative) seek refuge (Arabic III. is set aside ; see go aside, apart ; shelter, protection ; but ? = ס ) — Qal Perfect ׳ ח Ps 64:11 3 feminine singular חָסָ֫יָה Ps 57:2 , חָסִ֫יתִי Ps 7:2 + 7 t.; plural חָסוּ Ps 37:40 ; Zeph 3:12 , חָסָ֫יוּ Deut 32:37 Imperfect יֶחְסֶּה Ps 34:9 , תֶחְסֶּה Ps 91:4 , אֶחְסֶּה Ps 57:2 (see Baer Ps 34:9 ), אֶחֱסֶה Ps 18:3 + 2 t.; plural יֶחֱסוּ Isa 14:32 , יֶחֱסָיוּן Ps 36:8 Imperative חֲסוּ Judg 9:15 Infinitive חֲסוֺת Ps 118:8 + 3 t.; participle חוֺסֶה Isa 57:13 , חֹסֶה Prov 14:32 , חוֺסִים Ps 17:7 + 3 t.; חֹסְים Prov 30:5 ; 2Sam 22:31 (see Baer Prov 30:5 ), חוֺסֵי Ps 2:12 ; Ps 5:12 , חֹסֵי Nah 1:7 — seek refuge , with בְּצֵל ׃בְּ in the shadow of a tree Judg 9:15 , בְּצֵל מצרים Isa 30:2 בָּהּ Isa 14:32 in Zion, in gods Deut 32:37 (poem), elsewhere in God 2Sam 22:3 = Ps 18:3 ; Nah 1:7 ; Ps 2:12 ; Ps 5:12 ; Ps 7:2 ; Ps 11:1 ; Ps 16:1 ; Ps 25:20 ; Ps 31:2 ; Ps 31:20 ; Ps 34:9 ; Ps 34:23 ; Ps 37:40 ; Ps 57:2 ; Ps 64:11 ; Ps 71:1 ; Ps 118:8 ; Ps 118:9 ; Ps 141:8 ; Ps 144:2 , Isa 57:13 מגן הוא ל(כל ה)חוסים בו a shield is he to ( all ) who seek refuge in him 2Sam 22:31 = Ps 18:31 ; Prov 30:5 ׳ בְּ is probably to be supplied in thought at least: מושׁיע חוסים Ps 17:7 saviour of those seeking refuge (in thee); חסה במותו צדיק Prov 14:32 a righteous man in his death seeketh refuge (in Yahweh), ׳ בשׁם י Zeph 3:12 , בצל כנפיךָ in the shadow of thy wings Ps 36:8 ; Ps 57:2 בסתר כנפיךָ Ps 61:5 , תחת כנפיו under his wings Ps 91:4 = Ruth 2:12 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2971')\">BDB2971</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2620')\">H2620</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2970')\">BDB2970</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2972')\">BDB2972</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָסָה</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> (mostly in po